#: forms.py:40
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Paste a new webhook URL to change it. Leave empty to keep the current one."
msgstr ""
"Pega una nueva URL de webhook para cambiarla. Déjalo vacío para mantener la "
"actual."

#: forms.py:42
